{"title":"2001 IMO Shortlist Problems/N3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/N3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/0/39089b236548d379a1aed2197aadb2df20ff015f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 = 11^{11}, \\, a_2 = 12^{12}, \\, a_3 = 13^{13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"241\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/4/d74207062858039b3b1f94c2560305f3355c2e8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n = |a_{n - 1} - a_{n - 2}| + |a_{n - 2} - a_{n - 3}|, n \\geq 4.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"328\" height=\"18\" /> Determine <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/2/9e2de73a0b7bdda24e6d7c0099bdc196d6a97188.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{14^{14}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"33\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/N3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2001_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/N3&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/N3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_IMO_Shortlist_Problems\" title=\"2001 IMO Shortlist Problems\">2001 IMO Shortlist Problems</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=17472\">Discussion on AOPS/MathLinks</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018045146\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 31/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 432/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 638/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.232      1 Template:Solution\n100.00%    6.232      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:7199:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018045146 and revision id 27520. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}